      "title": "Sun-shading systems and selection",
      "summary": "The page surveys shutters, external blinds, inter-pane shading, vertical blades, awnings, roof overhangs, and double facades. System selection depends mainly on window orientation: movable systems are recommended for low east and west sun, while slight roof overhangs can suffice against high summer sun on south windows. External closed shading needs a route for heat to escape; systems close to windows can risk overheating or impair ventilation.",
